---
layout: base.njk
title: "China AI"
lang: ko
navSection: china-ai
pageScript: "/assets/info-kinds.js"
description: "China AI — one daily report on 11 China AI semiconductor names, published every weekday evening at 19:00 KST on HD2Lab InformationHub."
---
{% set briefings = collections.briefings %}
{% set days = collections.briefingDays %}
{% set dailies = collections.dailies %}
{% set spotlights = collections.spotlights %}
{% set latest = briefings[0] or null %}
{% set marketPost = briefings | firstWith("data.market") %}

<section class="page-hero shell" aria-labelledby="channel-title">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="{{ '/' | url }}">InformationHub</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">China AI</span>
    </nav>
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Channel 01 · Live</p>
    <h1 id="channel-title"><span class="channel-h1-flag" aria-hidden="true">🇨🇳</span> China AI</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-lede">Eleven names across AI chips, foundry, optics, memory and the materials in between. One report each weekday evening, after the close: the session, all eleven names, and what to watch next.</p>
    <p class="channel-note">월~금 저녁 19:00 KST에 하루 한 편, 11개 종목 리포트를 한국어로 발행합니다. 종목 하나를 깊게 다루는 스포트라이트는 그날 가장 이슈가 큰 이름으로 함께 나갑니다.</p>
    <div class="page-hero-meta">
        <span class="badge">11-Stock Watchlist</span>
        <span class="badge">Daily 19:00 KST · Mon–Fri</span>
        <span>{{ dailies | length }} daily</span>
        <span>{{ spotlights | length }} spotlight{% if spotlights | length != 1 %}s{% endif %}</span>
        <span>{% if latest %}Last update {{ latest.date | displayDate }}{% endif %}</span>
    </div>
</section>

{% if marketPost %}
<section class="channel-glance shell" aria-label="최신 리포트 요약과 밸류체인 구성">
    <div class="glance-card">
        <div class="glance-head">
            <h2>Latest snapshot · {{ marketPost.date | displayDate }}</h2>
            <a href="{{ marketPost.url | url }}">Read the report <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="glance-index-grid">
            {% for index in marketPost.data.market.indices %}
            <div class="glance-index">
                <span>{{ index.name }}</span>
                <strong>{{ index.value | num(2) }}</strong>
                <em class="is-{{ index.pct | pctTone }}">{{ index.pct | signedPct }}</em>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="glance-foot">
            {% if marketPost.data.market.turnover %}<span>거래대금 <strong>{{ marketPost.data.market.turnover }}</strong></span>{% endif %}
            {% if marketPost.data.market.semisInflow %}<span>반도체 순유입 <strong>{{ marketPost.data.market.semisInflow }}</strong></span>{% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="glance-card">
        <div class="glance-head">
            <h2>5개 섹터 · 11종목</h2>
            <a href="#watchlist">Watchlist <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="glance-sectors">
            {% for sector in sectors %}
            <div class="glance-sector">
                <span class="glance-sector-name"><strong>{{ sector.name }}</strong><span>{{ sector.en }}</span></span>
                <span class="glance-sector-count">{{ sector.codes | length }}종목</span>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="watchlist-section shell" id="watchlist" aria-labelledby="watchlist-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Watchlist</p>
            <h2 id="watchlist-title">The eleven.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Ticker, company, and the part of the supply chain each one sits in.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="watchlist-wrap">
        <table class="watchlist">
            <caption class="sr-only">China AI watchlist — 11 tickers</caption>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="col" class="th-index">#</th>
                    <th scope="col">Ticker</th>
                    <th scope="col">Company</th>
                    <th scope="col">Field</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for stock in stocks %}
                <tr>
                    <td class="td-index" data-label="#">{{ loop.index }}</td>
                    <td class="td-ticker" data-label="Ticker"><code>{{ stock.code }}</code></td>
                    <td class="td-company" data-label="Company">
                        <strong>{{ stock.en }}</strong>
                        <span class="stock-alt">{{ stock.zh }}{% if stock.ko != stock.en %} · {{ stock.ko }}{% endif %}</span>
                    </td>
                    <td class="td-field" data-label="Field">{{ stock.field }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="briefings-shell shell" id="briefings" aria-labelledby="briefings-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Archive</p>
            <h2 id="briefings-title">Daily reports.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>One report per weekday, newest first. Spotlights are the single-name features.</p>
    </div>

    {% if briefings | length %}
    <div class="kind-filter" data-kind-filter role="group" aria-label="리포트 유형 필터">
        <button type="button" data-kind="all" aria-pressed="true">All · {{ briefings | length }}</button>
        <button type="button" data-kind="daily" aria-pressed="false">Daily report · {{ dailies | length }}</button>
        <button type="button" data-kind="spotlight" aria-pressed="false">Spotlight · {{ spotlights | length }}</button>
        <span class="filter-note">Daily 19:00 KST · Spotlight 종목 특집</span>
    </div>
    <div class="archive" data-archive>
        {% for day in days %}
        <section class="archive-day" data-day-group="{{ day.key }}">
            <h3 class="archive-date">
                <time datetime="{{ day.key }}">{{ day.date | displayDate }}</time>
                <span>{{ day.date | weekday }}</span>
            </h3>
            <ul class="brief-rows">
                {% for post in day.posts %}
                {% set kind = post.data.reportKind or "daily" %}
                <li class="brief-row" data-kind="{{ kind }}">
                    <a href="{{ post.url | url }}">
                        <span class="brief-row-time"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | timeLabel }} KST</time></span>
                        <span class="brief-row-body">
                            <span class="brief-row-titlerow">
                                <span class="kind-badge kind-{{ kind }}">{% if kind == "spotlight" %}Spotlight{% else %}Daily{% endif %}</span>
                                <span class="brief-row-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
                            </span>
                            <span class="brief-row-summary">{{ post.data.summary }}</span>
                        </span>
                        <span class="brief-row-meta">{{ post.data.sources | length }} sources</span>
                        <span class="brief-row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </section>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="archive-empty" data-kind-empty hidden>이 유형의 리포트가 아직 없습니다.</p>
    {% else %}
    <p class="empty-state">The first report will land here after the next scheduled run.</p>
    {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="cta-band shell">
    <div>
        <h2>Follow the desk<br><span>from the top page.</span></h2>
        <p>Every channel’s newest report is on the landing page, with search across all of them.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button button-primary" href="{{ '/' | url }}">Back to InformationHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
</section>
